{"id":"cow","name":"Cow","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:cow"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Cow","text":"A cow and her calf were not to be killed on the same day (Lev. 22:28; Ex. 23:19; Deut. 22:6, 7). The reason for this enactment is not given. A state of great poverty is described in the words of Isa. 7:21-25, where, instead of possessing great resources, a man shall depend for the subsistence of himself and his family on what a single cow and two sheep could yield."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H5699","lemma":"עֲגָלָה","xlit":"ʻăgâlâh","gloss":"something revolving","kjv":"cart, chariot, wagon","count":4,"share":0.5},{"strong":"H6510","lemma":"פָּרָה","xlit":"pârâh","gloss":"a heifer","kjv":"cow, heifer, kine","count":4,"share":0.5},{"strong":"H712","lemma":"אַרְגָּז","xlit":"ʼargâz","gloss":"a box","kjv":"coffer","count":2,"share":0.25},{"strong":"H5763","lemma":"עוּל","xlit":"ʻûwl","gloss":"to suckle","kjv":"milch, with young","count":2,"share":0.25},{"strong":"H1053","lemma":"בֵּית שֶׁמֶשׁ","xlit":"Bêyth Shemesh","gloss":"Beth-Shemesh, a place in Palestine","kjv":"Beth-shemesh","count":2,"share":0.25},{"strong":"H631","lemma":"אָסַר","xlit":"ʼâçar","gloss":"to yoke or hitch","kjv":"bind, fast, gird, harness","count":2,"share":0.25}],"verses":["1Sam.6.7","1Sam.6.8","1Sam.6.10","1Sam.6.11","1Sam.6.9","1Sam.6.12","Hos.10.11","Amos.4.1"],"related":[{"id":"milk","type":"seealso","why":"Nave's Topical Bible lists it under See also"},{"id":"cattle","type":"seealso","why":"Nave's Topical Bible lists it under See also"},{"id":"cart","type":"cooccur","shared":6,"jaccard":0.462,"why":"6 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"ark-of-the-covenant","type":"cooccur","shared":6,"jaccard":0.041,"why":"6 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"providence-of-god","type":"cooccur","shared":5,"jaccard":0.03,"why":"5 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"ox","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.026,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},